{
  "id": "wf-optimize",
  "displayName": "优化 · 快速迭代",
  "description": "优化快速迭代正式模板：目标确认（生成并冻结 evaluation contract）→ 执行（最小必要修改，保护已满足部分）→ 评估（只输出 PASS / OPTIMIZE / CONFIRM）→ 收口；OPTIMIZE 回执行消耗自动回退额度（默认 3）；完成类型区分 EVALUATION_PASSED / USER_ACCEPTED。",
  "entry": "confirm",
  "control": {
    "maxRounds": 3
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "confirm",
      "profile": "requirements",
      "label": "目标确认",
      "goal": "与当前优化目标对齐，生成并冻结 evaluation contract（评估契约：优化目标、范围、已满足部分基线、可验证的评估标准与通过判据），写入 `evaluation-contract.md`。契约一经本节点输出即冻结，执行与评估节点只读引用，不得由执行或评估改写。contract_digest 必须是对 `evaluation-contract.md` 真实字节计算的小写十六进制 SHA-256（用本地命令如 sha256sum 或 node crypto 计算，不得凭空填写或自行编造摘要）；运行时会在本节点 READY 后读取原始字节重新计算并保存不可变副本，声称摘要与真实摘要不一致时本节点结果将被拒绝并要求重试。目标缺失或不可验证时如实写入契约的未决节并输出 BLOCKED。最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "READY",
                "BLOCKED"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "contract_digest": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "summary",
            "contract_digest"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "evaluation-contract.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "profile": "dev",
      "label": "执行",
      "goal": "只依据冻结的 evaluation contract 施工：运行时已把确认节点的契约保存为不可变副本（活动评价基线冻结副本，路径与 SHA-256 摘要见运行上下文的评价基线注入），原路径 `evaluation-contract.md` 不再是权威。采用最小必要修改达成未满足目标，显式保护已满足部分不被回归。发现活动评价基线因新事实、约束或环境变化已不再可执行时，输出 RECONFIRM_REQUIRED（这不是评估裁决，返回目标确认重新确认或修订契约；重新确认将产生显式新版本基线，旧版本基线的 PASS 不再适用）；外部条件无法安全继续时输出 BLOCKED；否则输出 READY。将执行交接写入 `execute-report.md`；最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "evaluation_verdict",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.route",
          "required": true,
          "default": "（首轮执行：尚无评估裁决，按冻结契约执行）"
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation_summary",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.summary",
          "required": true,
          "default": "（首轮执行：尚无评估摘要）"
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation_gaps",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.gaps",
          "required": true,
          "default": "（首轮执行：尚无评估差距清单）"
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation_contract_digest",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.contract_digest",
          "required": true,
          "default": "（首轮执行：尚无评估契约引用）"
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation_contract",
          "from": "$.results.confirm.contract_digest",
          "artifact": "evaluation-contract.md",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "current_deliverable",
          "from": "$.results.execute.changed",
          "artifact": "execute-report.md",
          "required": true,
          "default": "（首轮执行：尚无当前成果）"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "READY",
                "RECONFIRM_REQUIRED",
                "BLOCKED"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "changed": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "summary",
            "changed"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "execute-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluate",
      "profile": "evaluator",
      "label": "评估",
      "goal": "只依据冻结的 evaluation contract 评估执行结果：运行时已把确认节点的契约保存为不可变副本（活动评价基线冻结副本，路径与 SHA-256 摘要见运行上下文的评价基线注入），必须读取该冻结副本评估，原路径 `evaluation-contract.md` 不是权威；contract_digest 必须原样回填活动基线注入的摘要，与活动基线不一致的评估结论将被拒绝（旧版本基线的 PASS 不适用于新版本基线）。评估结论只允许三选一：PASS（已满足契约判据）/ OPTIMIZE（未满足，给出差距清单）/ CONFIRM（契约判据无法自动判定，升人工确认）。不改写执行节点的原结果，也不改写冻结契约。将评估报告（含 PASS/OPTIMIZE/CONFIRM 判据引用）写入 `evaluation-report.md`；最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PASS",
                "OPTIMIZE",
                "CONFIRM"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "contract_digest": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "gaps": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "summary",
            "contract_digest",
            "gaps"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "evaluation-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "closeout",
      "profile": "closeout",
      "label": "收口",
      "goal": "区分完成类型并收口：本轮经评估 PASS 自动进入时 completion_type=EVALUATION_PASSED；经人工决策 ACCEPT 进入时 completion_type=USER_ACCEPTED。保留评估报告与执行交接，不得重新开发或改写评估结论。完成后写 `cleanup-report.md`；最终回复只输出本节点 schema 对应 JSON。",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "evaluation_verdict",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.route",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation_summary",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.summary",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation_report",
          "from": "$.results.evaluate.summary",
          "artifact": "evaluation-report.md",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "execute_handover",
          "from": "$.results.execute.changed",
          "artifact": "execute-report.md",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.status",
        "completionPath": "$.completion_type",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "DELIVERED"
              ]
            },
            "completion_type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "EVALUATION_PASSED",
                "USER_ACCEPTED"
              ]
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "followups": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "status",
            "completion_type",
            "summary",
            "followups"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "cleanup-report.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "confirm",
      "to": "execute",
      "outcome": "READY"
    },
    {
      "from": "confirm",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "BLOCKED"
    },
    {
      "from": "confirm",
      "to": "confirm",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "execute",
      "to": "evaluate",
      "outcome": "READY"
    },
    {
      "from": "execute",
      "to": "confirm",
      "outcome": "RECONFIRM_REQUIRED",
      "countRound": false
    },
    {
      "from": "execute",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "BLOCKED"
    },
    {
      "from": "execute",
      "to": "execute",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "closeout",
      "outcome": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "execute",
      "outcome": "OPTIMIZE",
      "countRound": true
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "$human-decision",
      "outcome": "CONFIRM"
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "evaluate",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "$human-decision",
      "to": "closeout",
      "outcome": "ACCEPT",
      "subsequent_effect": "人工确认：按 USER_ACCEPTED 完成类型收口，决策材料含冻结 evaluation contract 摘要"
    },
    {
      "from": "closeout",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "DELIVERED"
    },
    {
      "from": "closeout",
      "to": "closeout",
      "on": "technical"
    }
  ],
  "bindings": {
    "models": {
      "confirm": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "execute": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "evaluate": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-v4-flash"
      },
      "closeout": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      }
    }
  },
  "evaluationBaseline": {
    "artifact": "evaluation-contract.md",
    "digestField": "contract_digest",
    "producerNode": "confirm"
  },
  "heteroCheck": "weak"
}
